.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt SSL_GET_SSL_CTX 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm SSL_get_SSL_CTX
.Nd get the SSL_CTX from which an SSL is created
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/ssl.h
.Ft SSL_CTX *
.Fo SSL_get_SSL_CTX
.Fa "const SSL *ssl"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn SSL_get_SSL_CTX
returns a pointer to the SSL_CTX object, from which
.Fa ssl
was created with
.Xr SSL_new 3 .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
The pointer to the SSL_CTX object is returned.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ssl 7 ,
.Xr SSL_new 3
